      ],
      "source": "https://www.theroute-66.com/helendale.html",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A historic marker 100 yards south of Route 66 and Vista Road commemorates the old road that once ran through Helendale.",
